ivate golfer plans.\n        - generic [ref=e265]: Editing or archiving a linked package creates a new withdrawn plan revision, clears publication approval, and revokes active links until you review and publish again. Roadmap never treats an external click as a booking, purchase, or sale.\n      - generic [ref=e266]:\n        - group \"Add a package you already sell\" [ref=e268]:\n          - generic [ref=e270]:\n            - generic [ref=e271]:\n              - text: Package name\n              - textbox \"Package name\" [disabled] [ref=e272]: Foundation rebuild\n            - generic [ref=e273]:\n              - text: Why it fits\n              - textbox \"Why it fits\" [disabled] [ref=e274]: A structured three-phase coaching block for a golfer rebuilding contact and confidence.\n            - generic [ref=e275]:\n              - text: Price in CAD (optional)\n              - spinbutton \"Price in CAD (optional) This is the instructor’s coaching-package price, not the Roadmap subscription.\" [disabled] [ref=e276]: \"720\"\n              - generic [ref=e277]: This is the instructor’s coaching-package price, not the Roadmap subscription.\n            - generic [ref=e278]:\n              - text: Current details when no price is shown\n              - textbox \"Current details when no price is shown Provide either an exact price or an honest current-details message.\" [disabled] [ref=e279]:\n                - /placeholder: Confirm current price with me\n              - generic [ref=e280]: Provide either an exact price or an honest current-details message.\n            - generic [ref=e281]:\n              - text: Material inclusions — one per line\n              - textbox \"Material inclusions — one per line List only what this package currently includes. Do not imply booking or payment has occurred.\" [disabled] [ref=e282]:\n                - /placeholder: \"Four individual lessons\\nWritten practice direction\\nEnd-of-phase review\"\n                - text: Four individual lessons\n              - generic [ref=e283]: List only what this package currently includes. Do not imply booking or payment has occurred.\n            - generic [ref=e284]:\n              - text: Cadence (optional)\n              - textbox \"Cadence (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=e285]:\n                - /placeholder: Four lessons over six to eight weeks\n                - text: Four lessons over eight weeks\n            - generic [ref=e286]:\n              - text: Practice expectation (optional)\n              - textbox \"Practice expectation (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=e287]: Two focused practice sessions each week, adjusted from check-ins.\n            - generic [ref=e288]:\n              - text: Evaluation approach (optional)\n              - textbox \"Evaluation approach (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=e289]: Baseline, lesson observations, golfer feedback, and end-of-phase review.\n            - generic [ref=e290]:\n              - text: Terms\n              - textbox \"Terms\" [disabled] [ref=e291]:\n                - /placeholder: Sessions, expected window, expiry, rescheduling, and renewal terms.\n                - text: Four sessions used within ten weeks. Rescheduling requires 24 hours notice.\n            - generic [ref=e292]:\n              - text: Existing HTTPS booking, purchase, or contact link\n              - textbox \"Existing HTTPS booking, purchase, or contact link Roadmap makes the handoff clear; it does not claim the external action completed.\" [disabled] [ref=e293]: https://coach.example.ca/book/foundation\n              - generic [ref=e294]: Roadmap makes the handoff clear; it does not claim the external action completed.\n        - alert [active] [ref=e295]:\n          - strong [ref=e298]: There was a problem.\n          - generic [ref=e299]: \"Roadmap could not confirm whether the package was saved. Check your connection, then try this same action again; Roadmap will reuse the same attempt. Reference: 439c968e-b518-4cfa-94ee-0482b60f